Notes for the
file manager.
This first
paragraph is one
long line, so the
pager has to wrap
it at word
boundaries,
measuring each
word by its
display width
rather than by
its bytes.

Wide characters
count twice: 漢字
の幅は二つ, and
so does an emoji
😀 in the middle
of a sentence.

A word longer
than any line,
such as
Pneumonoultramicr
oscopicsilicovolc
anoconiosis-and-
then-some-more-
letters-to-be-
sure, is broken
between grapheme
clusters.
